THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

This repository does not vendor any third-party source. It contains three patch
files, each a diff against a package published on npm:

  patches/@kabelsalat__web@0.4.1.patch
      A diff against @kabelsalat/web@0.4.1 (kabelsalat contributors), adding an
      "exports" map to its package.json. kabelsalat is AGPL-3.0-or-later.

  patches/superdough@1.3.0.patch
      A one-line diff against superdough@1.3.0 (Strudel contributors), inserting
      a statement into nodePools.mjs. superdough is AGPL-3.0-or-later.

  patches/fraction.js@5.3.4.patch
      A diff against fraction.js@5.3.4 (Robert Eisele), inserting a statement
      into newFraction. fraction.js is MIT.

Each patch is licensed under the terms of the package it modifies, not under this
repository's licence. None of these packages is redistributed here; they are
fetched from npm at install time by the pinned pnpm-lock.yaml.

The two WAV files in audio/ are renders produced by Strudel's own renderPatternAudio
from patterns authored for this study. They are published as measurement data.
